00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.490 line:92%
I really love a wig. And I -

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.425 line:92%
We did a Zoom birthday party

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
