00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.169 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know --

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.839
I can't remember what
my character's name was anymore,

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:48.641 line:92%
but at some point, I had -

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:53.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's the -- I had
a Merida wig on from "Brave.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:53.680 size:75% position:38% line:92%
