00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.130 line:92%
-She was really hateable.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's good. I see --
These are --

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:13.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
