00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.174 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.709 line:92%
I was wondering what you think

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:24.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
