episode for that.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:51.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like it really held o
to that spirit --

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:52.305 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It reminded me so much

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:54.007
of that spirit of when we worked
at the show.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.575
-Yeah.
-You know, when we worked there,

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:58.111 line:92%
it was after September 11th.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:00.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
I remember having
to come into the writer's room

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:05.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
