we kept working."

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:25.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's a looseness
and a joy

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:28.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a goofiness
in those episodes.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:32.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then -- And seeing Kenan
in a blanket as a costume

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.580 line:92%
was like maybe my favorite

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.783
-Yeah, Kenan in a blanket'
always going to be a winner.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.918 line:92%
-It's the top of my list.

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:41.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I have to say, it's pretty
amazing to turn it on,

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:45.258
you know, the next time they d
"Saturday Night Live At Home,"

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:49.529
and people --
I mean, Brad Pitt playing Fauci.

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:52.732 size:84% position:42%
I mean, it's beautiful.
It's all so beautiful,

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
everybody pitching in
and doing it --

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:57.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
