00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.907 size:84% position:42% line:92%
it's -- it's beautiful.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:05.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the spirit of the sho
that I genuinely love the most

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:07.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and I really have a ton
of respect

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.748 size:84% position:42%
