00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It was magical.

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:28.361 size:81% position:41% line:92%
