00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:33.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
We actually didn't --
We didn't --

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:35.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
The kids --
The kids used the iPads.

00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:38.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
We just sat and had
a really nice, quiet dinner.

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:41.274 line:92%
But it was pretty awesome.

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:43.776 line:92%
But, I mean, you know, my --

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:47.880
I have to say, there are so many
